  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|description": "Plumb a rain collector into a building with a pipe wrench and it feeds every fixture in it, not just the one sitting in the 3x3 directly above. Barrels go anywhere: on the roof they feed every floor below for free, and a generator on a barrel's square pushes water up as well. A tap reads all of them added up and they drain together. Run iron pipe out to a shed, a yard or the house next door and they all share one supply. Right-click a fixture to pick which liquid it draws, and run whiskey, beer or milk to it instead. Water dispensers plumb in the other way around, to be kept full from the supply. Safe to add mid-save. Before removing it, run Uninstall from the debug menu. Singleplayer, hosted multiplayer and dedicated server.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|name": "LG Extended Plumbing",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing": "Extended Plumbing",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Debug": "Log plumbing decisions",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Debug_tooltip": "Writes every plumbing change to the log file. Only useful for tracking down a problem.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Enabled": "Enable extended plumbing",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Enabled_tooltip": "A rain collector plumbed into a building feeds every plumbed fixture in it, not just the one right below. Turn this off for normal plumbing.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_FedFixtures": "Containers the supply fills",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_FedFixtures_tooltip": "Things that can be plumbed in to be FILLED by the supply instead of feeding it. Water dispensers by default. You still have to right-click one and plumb it with a pipe wrench. Use the object's script name, separated by semicolons. Clear the box to turn this off.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_FluidPatch": "Fix taps that pour drinks",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_FluidPatch_tooltip": "Fixes a base game bug that empties your barrels without filling anything. It only hits drinks like cola, juice and vodka. Water, beer and whiskey were never affected.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Reach": "Reach outside a building",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_Reach_tooltip": "How far a fixture looks for barrels when it is not in a real building, like a base you built yourself. Inside a real building the whole building is used and this does nothing. 12 covers a good sized base.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_WasherPatch": "Fix washing machines in multiplayer",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedPlumbing/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedPlumbing_WasherPatch_tooltip": "Fixes two base game bugs on servers: a washing machine you cannot plumb, and one that keeps running on your screen after it runs dry. Singleplayer does not need it."
}
